<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="上传组" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="UploadGroup">UploadGroup</desc><desc>一个上传组可连续添加多个文件：上传完成后仍会显示「添加」入口，直到达到上限。本页仅将选择结果记在本地，离开页面后清空。</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">图片上传组</title><desc type="prop" text="list / limit / column">list / limit / column</desc><desc>已选 {{imageList.length}} / {{imageLimit}}，上传后可继续添加</desc><mx-upload-group type="image" column="{{3}}" limit="{{imageLimit}}" list="{{imageList}}" chooseText="继续添加" bind:upload_group_change="handleImageChange" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">视频上传组</title><desc>已选 {{videoList.length}} / {{videoLimit}}，上传后可继续添加</desc><mx-upload-group type="video" column="{{4}}" limit="{{videoLimit}}" list="{{videoList}}" chooseText="继续添加" bind:upload_group_change="handleVideoChange" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">文件上传组</title><desc>已选 {{fileList.length}} / {{fileLimit}}，上传后可继续添加</desc><mx-upload-group type="file" column="{{5}}" limit="{{fileLimit}}" list="{{fileList}}" chooseText="继续添加" bind:upload_group_change="handleFileChange" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">禁用</title><desc type="prop" text="disabled">disabled</desc><mx-upload-group type="image" column="{{4}}" limit="{{4}}" chooseText="添加图片" list="{{disabledList}}" disabled /></wrap><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view> 